### ==========================================
### ⭐ REVIEW - Ulasan Event
### File: routes/review.routes.js
### Controller: controllers/reviewController.js
### Catatan: Jalankan migrasi dulu jika tabel
### reviews belum ada:
### npx sequelize-cli db:migrate
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@userToken = PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE

### ──────────────────────────────────────────
### Buat Ulasan Event [Admin & User]
### Route: POST /review/event/:eventID/review
### Controller: createReview
### Middleware: authorize, allowRoles('admin', 'user')
### Syarat: Harus sudah beli tiket event ini,
### hanya bisa review 1x per event
### ──────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/review/event/1/review
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Event yang sangat bagus!"
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────
### Get Semua Ulasan Event [PUBLIC]
### Route: GET /review/event/:eventID/reviews
### Controller: getEventReviews
### Middleware: - (public, tanpa token)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/review/event/1/reviews

### ──────────────────────────────────────────
### Hapus Ulasan [Admin & User]
### Route: DELETE /review/review/:reviewID
### Controller: deleteReview
### Middleware: authorize, allowRoles('admin', 'user')
### User hanya bisa hapus ulasan sendiri,
### Admin bisa hapus ulasan siapapun
### ──────────────────────────────────────────
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/review/review/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
